Content-Type: text/plain; charset="us-ascii"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable

Ingredients

  *   Approx. 40 strawberries
  *   300 grams of sugar
  *   100 ml of vanilla extract
  *   1000 ml of whipping cream
  *   4 tablespoons (60 ml) of chopped pistachios
Preparation

  1.  Cut the strawberries into quarters.
  2.  Whip the cream with the sugar and vanilla until it doubles in volume.
  3.  Add the strawberries and mix carefully with a spoon.
  4.  When serving, decorate with the pistachios.

This doubled recipe should serve approximately 8 people. Enjoy making this =
delicious dessert! If you have any other questions or need further assistan=
ce, feel free to ask.
https://www.cocinafacil.com.mx/recetas/fresas-con-crema

